WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:10.469
How's it going over there?

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:13.096
You're really ruining my flow
right now, you know that?

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:17.434
We got an issue.
There's movement, man.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.274
We have 15 minutes.

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:27.945
It's time.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.449
Hit it.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:37.955
Hello, boys.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:45.462
What if I told you...

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.756
I know what happens
when you die?

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.301
You become a ghost.

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.721
No more criminal records.

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:56.723
No more office parties.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.267
Or stupid weddings.

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:00.686
Best part of being dead...

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:03.522
is the freedom.

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:07.442
Not policies or politics.

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:09.444
No one touch. He's mine.

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:16.618
We answer to no one.

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:24.918
We could take out
some truly evil people.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.379
We're stuck at the stairwell.

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.714
Guys, I got a bad idea.

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:30.924
Don't have bad ideas.
Have good ideas.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.646
Was that a bad guy?

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:48.859
These people
were declared dead.

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:50.652
None of us
will be remembered.

00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:52.362
What's about to happen will.

00:01:52.446 --> 00:01:54.698
Good things can erase
the bad ones, right?

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:55.824
Who the hell are you?

00:01:57.743 --> 00:01:58.785
We're no one.

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:00.829
If they exist...

00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:02.831
they could be made not to.

00:02:02.914 --> 00:02:04.583
Papi, they have fighter jets!

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:10.047
-Are you seeing that?
-Yes!

00:02:18.055 --> 00:02:19.306
Sorry for yelling.

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:22.559
Welcome to the world's
biggest magnet.

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:24.645
Are you out of your mind?

00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:29.024
Grenade!

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.000
I wasn't sure it'd work.

00:02:47.084 --> 00:02:50.087
I mean, I wasn't sure, sure.
I had a suspicion, but I...

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:52.547
God, this is all
so fucking dangerous.

